# Symbols the EL3 monitor archive may leave unresolved (one ERE per line).
# Anything else pulls SPM, service, or crypto code into EL3 (WT-PORT-0012).
^wt_gic_
^wt_esr_
^wt_platform_(console_putc|console_flush|panic|system_reset|sip_smc|board_[a-z_]+)$
^g_wt_monitor_event$
^wt_spm_entry$
^(memset|memcpy)$
^__(el3|spm|data|bss|stack)_[a-z_]+$
